error[habit:when-body] 6:11-6:45
            (call store.put {:id "b" :size 2}))]
            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  A when has one expression, but this one has 2.
  Run several steps in order with do: (when test (do step1 step2)).
  Fix: (when true (do (call store.put {:id "a" :size 1}) (call store.put {:id "b" :size 2})))
